+## Failed session setup
+
+If `beforeSession` throws an `Error`, the caller receives that same error, `onError` receives the session and error, and `afterSession` then receives the session; `afterSession` must allow for partial setup because no later turn hook or model call has run and `beforeSession` may have allocated only some resources ([validated by: reports and cleans up a failed beforeSession without starting the turn](../../src/orchestration/beforeSessionFailure.acceptance.test.ts#L7)).
+
 ## Measured semantics — out of scope
 
-These three properties of `src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.ts` are recorded so the hook features that follow specify against real behaviour. This issue changes none of them; each is a separate, out-of-scope change owned by no issue in this epic.
